      "text_zh": "残余异文：RA-047 · 蚀流余烬\n归属意志：第 VIII 层 · 慢性消蚀意志\n异常概述：收容前曾致第 ██ 铸字坊全部铅字在铸印 ██ 次后重量降至初始值的 ██%。受影响工段的铅水储罐出现异常沉积物，呈黑色结晶状，触感温热。现存样本共计 ██ 公斤，储于密封铅罐。\n收容残余：当前压制状态下，仅影响部分铭文组的铸印饱和度。键徒报告'铅字变轻了，但看不出区别'。\n附注：覆盖面积与蚀失强度呈负相关。原因待查明。实验记录显示集中使用反而减缓衰减，违反直观预期。\n——「少铸██字，重于千言」",
      "text_en": "Residual Anomaly: RA-047 · Erosion Ember\nManifestation of Will: Layer VIII · Gradual Corrosion\nAnomalous Overview: Pre-containment caused all lead slugs in Workshop ██ to degrade to ██% of initial mass after ██ impressions. Affected sections' lead cisterns developed anomalous sediment deposits - crystalline, black, warm to touch. ██ kg of samples remain in sealed lead containers.\nContainment Residue: Under current suppression, only affects impression saturation of designated inscription sets. Operators report 'slugs feel lighter, though no visible difference'.\nAddendum: Coverage area inversely correlates with erosion intensity. Cause undetermined. Test logs show concentrated usage paradoxically slows degradation.\n—'To omit one glyph weighs more than a thousand words'"
