      "text_en": "Residual Anomaly: RA-029 · Temporal Backflow\nManifestation of Will: Layer IX · Reverse Sequence\nAnomalous Overview: Pre-containment required all textual work in affected areas to begin from terminal characters. Operators attempting forward inscription experienced involuntary finger movement toward final positions. Complete incident report shows D-████ developed temporary aphasia after forced forward operation, recovering with permanently inverted speech patterns.\nContainment Residue: Lead glyphs display in reverse sequence during inscription. Operators must proceed right-to-left. Efficiency largely normalizes after adaptation period.\nAddendum: Long-term psychological effects of reverse operation under evaluation. Three prolonged-exposure operators exhibit occasional word-order inversion in casual speech, though subjects remain unaware of anomaly.\n—'The end is the beginning, return is the path forward'"
