      "text_en": "Residual Anomaly: RA-063 · Punctuation Corrosion\nManifestation of Will: Layer V · Symbolic Parasitism\nAnomalous Overview: Pre-containment caused unauthorized punctuation marks to proliferate within text gaps of affected codices in mycelial spreading patterns. Severely infected pages contained punctuation density exceeding letters themselves while maintaining readability. Infected samples reveal ██ unrecorded punctuation forms, some exhibiting mild vibration upon contact.\nContainment Residue: During inscription, words randomly develop additional punctuation marks internally. Operators must accurately reproduce displayed content including inserted symbols.\nAddendum: Symbol insertion correlates with operator stress levels. Tests show deliberate relaxation reduces anomalous marks but cannot eliminate them entirely. One incident report inexplicably concluded with seventeen question marks.\n—'Between words, symbols whisper in secret'"
